   <standOff><listPerson><person xml:id="person3829"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">po to ba rin chen gsal</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">པོ་ཏོ་བ་རིན་ཆེན་གསལ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">pu to ba</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rin chen gsal</persName><birth notBefore="1027-01-01" notAfter="1027-12-31">1027</birth><death notBefore="1105-01-01" notAfter="1105-12-31">1105</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P3442</idno><idno type="APIS">3829</idno><note type="comment">Part of the group called  the "three brothers" (sku mched gsum), composed of Po to ba (ID:3829), Phu chung ba (ID:7093), Spyan snga ba (ID:3830).</note></person><person xml:id="person3856"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">phag mo gru pa rdo rje rgyal po</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཕག་མོ་གྲུ་པ་རྡོ་རྗེ་རྒྱལ་པོ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">chos tsha ba</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dpal mtha' rtsa ba</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dpal chos kyi rje 'gro ba'i mgon po</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rje khams pa rdor rgyal</persName><birth notBefore="1110-01-01" notAfter="1110-12-31">1110</birth><death notBefore="1170-01-01" notAfter="1170-12-31">1170</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P127</idno><idno type="APIS">3856</idno><note type="comment">The nickname "chos tsha ba" is explained in [WBWSEPQX]: 4b (lar mtshan nyid kyi grwa sar lo mang du bzhugs te | khams pa yar 'dug pa la chos tsha ba'i grags pa thob).&#13;
Sho sgom (ID:3857), Dus gsum mkhyen pa (ID:3855) and Phag mo gru pa (ID:3856) are known as the "grub thob mi gsum" and as the "khams pa mi gsum."</note></person><person xml:id="person4106"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dol pa shes rab rgya mtsho</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">དོལ་པ་ཤེས་རབ་རྒྱ་མཚོ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">ya gad pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dge bshes ya gad pa</persName><birth notBefore="1059-01-01" notAfter="1059-12-31">1059</birth><death notBefore="1131-01-01" notAfter="1131-12-31">1131</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P1840</idno><idno type="APIS">4106</idno><note type="comment">For the sources attesting personal relations, see [RA7ID7QP] L1576.&#13;
BUDA identifies the author of work (ID:5341) as a Ya gad pa born in 1171 (http://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P4872), who could not have been a teacher of Phag mo gru pa (ID:3856).</note></person><person xml:id="person4141"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">btsan kha bo che</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">བཙན་ཁ་བོ་ཆེ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dri med shes rab</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">phu rangs pa chen po</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">btsan kha ba che</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dge tshul spu rangs pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">btsan</persName><birth notBefore="1021-01-01" notAfter="1021-12-31">1021</birth><death notBefore="1042-01-01" notAfter="1100-12-31">after 1042 before 1100</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P4654</idno><idno type="APIS">4141</idno><note type="comment">According to [R894SIKE]: 99, he was 23 when Atiśa (ID:3745) came to Tibet (in 1042).</note></person><person xml:id="person4193"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rgya 'dul 'dzin brtson 'grus 'bar</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">རྒྱ་འདུལ་འཛིན་བརྩོན་འགྲུས་འབར</persName><birth notBefore="0989-01-01" notAfter="1121-12-31">after 989 before 1121</birth><death notBefore="1069-01-01" notAfter="1201-12-31">after 1069 before 1201</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">4193</idno><note type="comment">Also referred to as "rGya 'Dul 'dzin the younger" to distinguish him from "rGya 'Dul 'dzin the older" (ID:3941). See [647FFPZR]: 541.&#13;
It is unclear whether he is the same person as Bya 'dul ba 'dzin pa (ID:3818). The [NA9AMDH6] distinguishes two "rGya 'dul 'dzin" - the elder (ID: 3941) and the younger (ID:4193) - and a "Bya 'dul 'dzin brTson 'grus 'bar" (student of 'Bre chen po). In contrast, the [MQB8JGAX] only mentions one "rGya 'dul 'dzin" (the elder), distinct from "Bya 'dul 'dzin" (who was ordained by 'Bre). &#13;
A number of the same teachers are mentioned for rGya 'dul 'dzin the younger and Bya 'dul 'dzin but, for instance, the latter's studies with rGya 'dul 'dzin the older took place when he was a retired abbot, whereas the former's studies with him took place when he was still abbot.&#13;
Further, rGya 'dul 'dzin the younger became abbot of dGa' ba sdong and Bya 'dul abbot of Zul phu.&#13;
This suggests they might have been distinct persons.</note></person><person xml:id="person5344"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">lha 'bri sgang pa</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ལྷ་འབྲི་སྒང་པ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">lha 'bri sgang ba</persName><birth notBefore="1100-01-01">after 1100</birth><death notAfter="1199-12-31">before 1199</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P4862</idno><idno type="APIS">5344</idno></person><person xml:id="person6111"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">gre lhas pa</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">གྲེ་ལྷས་པ</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">6111</idno></person><person xml:id="person6208"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rog mngon pa</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">རོག་མངོན་པ</persName><birth notBefore="0989-01-01" notAfter="1121-12-31">after 989 before 1121</birth><death notBefore="1069-01-01" notAfter="1201-12-31">after 1069 before 1201</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">6208</idno></person><person xml:id="person7179"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">don stengs pa</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">དོན་སྟེངས་པ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">don steng pa</persName><birth notBefore="1040-01-01" notAfter="1121-12-31">after 1040 before 1121</birth><death notBefore="1120-01-01" notAfter="1240-12-31">after 1120 before 1240</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">7179</idno></person></listPerson><listBibl><bibl xml:id="work5341"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bka' gdams kyi man ngag be bum sngon po'i 'grel pa</title><title xml:lang="bo">བཀའ་གདམས་ཀྱི་མན་ངག་བེ་བུམ་སྔོན་པོའི་འགྲེལ་པ</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1069-01-01" notAfter="1131-12-31">after 1069 before 1131</date><author ref="pe